      "name": "Getting Started.md",
      "path": "Assets/Tutorials/Getting Started.md",
      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 310,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: platformer\n---\n# Welcome to Nova_A Platformer Character\n\nThis project was created from the **platformer** template. Open the Scene, Assets, Script, Debug, and Manage workspaces to explore the configured systems. Dismiss this tutorial from its Asset Inspector when you are ready.",
